fense, planet by planet, in a high-stakes shoot \u2018em up adventure. Featuring intense 16-bit action that harks back to the glory days of Japanese arcade shooters, \u201eProject Neon\u201c promises a thrilling challenge.\n\nAre you ready to face the ultimate shooter challenge and save Earth?", "summary": "Project Neon is a new, vertical / TATE style Shoot 'Em Up (shmup), developed for the original Neo Geo MVS / AES platform. It features a 1-2 player mode, with all the bells and whistles of a classic shoot 'em up that you would expect, spiced up with some modern and unique concepts and game mechanics.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/project-neon"}